<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome - Elite Escapes API</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            max-width: 800px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #667eea;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 36px;
        }
        .tagline {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .section h2 {
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #667eea;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .section p {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .endpoints {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .endpoint {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        .endpoint:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
            margin-bottom: 0;
            padding-bottom: 0;
        }
        .method {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-right: 10px;
            color: white;
        }
        .method-get {
            background-color: #28a745;
        }
        .method-post {
            background-color: #007bff;
        }
        .method-put {
            background-color: #ffc107;
        }
        .method-delete {
            background-color: #dc3545;
        }
        .path {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            color: #333;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .description {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Welcome to Elite Escapes API</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Your complete tour booking and travel management system</p>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>About This API</h2>
            <p>Elite Escapes is a comprehensive RESTful API designed for tour booking and travel management. Built with Node.js, Express, and MongoDB, it provides robust endpoints for managing users, packages, bookings, and reviews.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>API Endpoints</h2>
            
            <div class="endpoints">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #667eea; font-size: 16px;">Authentication</h3>
                
                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-post">POST</span><span class="path">/api/auth/signup</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Create a new user account</div>
                </div>

                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-post">POST</span><span class="path">/api/auth/login</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Login with email and password</div>
                </div>

                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-get">GET</span><span class="path">/api/auth/profile</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Get current user profile (Protected)</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="endpoints">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #667eea; font-size: 16px;">Packages</h3>
                
                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-get">GET</span><span class="path">/api/packages</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Get all available tour packages</div>
                </div>

                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-get">GET</span><span class="path">/api/packages/:packageId</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Get details of a specific package</div>
                </div>

                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-post">POST</span><span class="path">/api/packages</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Create a new package (Protected - Admin)</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="endpoints">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #667eea; font-size: 16px;">Bookings</h3>
                
                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-get">GET</span><span class="path">/api/bookings</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Get all bookings (Admin)</div>
                </div>

                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-get">GET</span><span class="path">/api/bookings/user</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Get user's bookings (Protected)</div>
                </div>

                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-post">POST</span><span class="path">/api/bookings</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Create a new booking (Protected)</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="endpoints">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #667eea; font-size: 16px;">Reviews</h3>
                
                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-get">GET</span><span class="path">/api/reviews</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Get all reviews</div>
                </div>

                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-get">GET</span><span class="path">/api/reviews/package/:packageId</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Get reviews for a specific package</div>
                </div>

                <div class="endpoint">
                    <div><span class="method method-post">POST</span><span class="path">/api/reviews</span></div>
                    <div class="description">Create a new review (Protected)</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Architecture</h2>
            <p><strong>This API follows the MVC (Model-View-Controller) architecture:</strong></p>
            <ul style="margin-left: 20px; color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">
                <li><strong>Models:</strong> Database schemas for User, Package, Booking, and Review</li>
                <li><strong>Controllers:</strong> Business logic for authentication, packages, bookings, and reviews</li>
                <li><strong>Views:</strong> Server-side rendered templates for emails, error pages, and admin dashboard</li>
                <li><strong>Routes:</strong> RESTful API endpoints</li>
                <li><strong>Middleware:</strong> Authentication, logging, and file upload handling</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Getting Started</h2>
            <p><strong>Frontend URL:</strong> The React client is served separately from the API.</p>
            <p><strong>API Base URL:</strong> <%= apiBaseUrl || 'http://localhost:3000/api' %></p>
            <p>All requests should include the `Content-Type: application/json` header.</p>
            <p>Protected endpoints require a valid JWT token in the Authorization header: `Bearer &lt;token&gt;`</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2024 Elite Escapes Tours & Travels. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>For API documentation, contact: developers@eliteescapes.com</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
